ADDITIONAL DISCLAIMER (Bastion Hardening Framework)

This tool makes significant changes to Windows (services, firewall, registry,
optional features, AppX packages, DNS, Microsoft Defender settings, and related
components).

- Always create a System Restore Point before using Apply or Quick Harden.
- It can disable printing (Print Spooler), network discovery, the OneDrive
  client, Xbox clients, Widgets, and other features.
- It is intended for a single personal workstation you administer.
- It is NOT designed for domain-joined, Intune/MDM-managed, or corporate machines.
- The author(s) and contributors accept no responsibility for data loss, broken
